    "weight-dequantization-markdown-code-3": "M = 4，N = 4，TILE_SIZE = 2\nX = [[10, 10, 5, 5],\n     [10, 10, 5, 5],\n     [ 2,  2, 8, 8],\n     [ 2,  2, 8, 8]]\nS = [[0.5, 2.0],\n     [4.0, 0.25]]\nY = [[5.0, 5.0, 10.0, 10.0],\n     [5.0, 5.0, 10.0, 10.0],\n     [8.0, 8.0,  2.0,  2.0],\n     [8.0, 8.0,  2.0,  2.0]]",
    "weight-dequantization-markdown-code-4": "#include <cuda_runtime.h>\n\n// X, S, Y are device pointers\nextern \"C\" void solve(const float* X, const float* S, float* Y,\n                      int M, int N, int TILE_SIZE) {}",
    "weight-dequantization-markdown-code-5": "row = index / N\ncol = index % N\nscaleRow = row / TILE_SIZE\nscaleCol = col / TILE_SIZE",
